DESCRIPTION:National Cat Day falls on October 29 and was founded in 2005 by
  Colleen Paige\, the pet lifestyle expert who created National Dog Day the
  year before. Unlike the dog day\, this one comes with no explanation for 
 its date: the founding site says what the day is for but never says why Oc
 tober 29. What it is for is adoption\, and specifically the number of cats
  sitting in American shelters.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/nati
 onal-cat-day/
